WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Choose a collection and who can use it. Then add it.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
In that workspace, check Ready and the installed count.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
After Reload, the installed copy is now version 1.0.1.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Find the installed blueprint, then use it in a new session.
